@M_KOJO_MESSAGE_COM_K1_180_選択肢

PRINTDL This might be a bit out of the blue, but are you open to fetish content?
PRINTDL ※It's not that niche※

PRINT [0] Yes
PRINT [1] No
;PRINT [2] Hol'up
PRINT [3] Tell me more
PRINT [9] Other
;改行で整える為の物
PRINTL 

$INPUT_LOOP＿K1_180_選択肢
INPUT

	;0.イベントがオフだよ　選択肢が出るよ　　初期値の事情だよ
	;1.イベントがオンだよ　選択肢が出るよ
	;2.イベントがオフだよ　選択肢を出さないよ
	;3.イベントがオンだよ　選択肢を出さないよ
	;4.イベントがオフだよ　選択肢が出るよ　　bit2が真だよ
	
	;1=オン（bit0）　2=選択肢を出さないよ（bit1）
	;4=簡単に条件を付け足せるよ（bit2）

SELECTCASE RESULT
	CASE 0
		PRINTDL You chose "yes".
			CFLAG:1500 = 3
	CASE 1
		PRINTDL You chose "no".
			CFLAG:1500 = 2
	CASE 2
		PRINTDL Alright, I'll hol'up.
			CFLAG:1500 = 0
	CASE 3
		PRINTDL You get to licky licky sucky sucky on Reimu's feet, nothing serious.
		GOTO INPUT_LOOP＿K1_180_選択肢
	CASE 9
		PRINTDL The third option:
		PRINTDL Go back to previous choice.
		GOTO INPUT_LOOP＿K1_180_選択肢
	CASEELSE
		PRINTFORMDW I'll send you back to the previous choice.
		GOTO INPUT_LOOP＿K1_180_選択肢
	ENDSELECT
PRINTFORMDW Understood. Now then, please enjoy your (sex) life with Reimu...

RETURN 1
